ities that another Twilight would bring to the table. Lore, Occult (And Sorcery), and Investigation all would be huge assets to the Circle at this moment, especially with the skullduggery that the ST is heavily hinting at, making having a magical Super Sherlock Wright incredibly useful.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, but the Boule is framing us for murder, and it looks like we really were the ones who did it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, yes, well, actually, I found a hair from none of us in the room, a glove with blood on it in an alley behind the building that the murder took place, and it fits none of us, and also my demon saw everything that happened. CASE CLOSED!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T20:40:59-07:00","id":137651,"title":"","content":"So, what are you looking for for new characters? And how many PCs do you have so far?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T11:12:51-07:00","id":138259,"title":"","content":"We have four PCs with a fifth in the wings. A crafty-killy-statesman, a killy-crafter, a crafty-killer, and an underhanded-socialite. The oncoming PC looks to be an investigative-sorcerer. Maybe a sneaky person? <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"u